      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01261",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "对眼前的我来说，想起的这句话是很不愉快的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For me now, remembering those words was deeply unpleasant.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01261",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "不管怎样说，结巴还是五官端正、四肢健全的人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After all, a stutterer is still someone with regular features and sound limbs,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01261",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "所以我与柏木不同，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so unlike Kashiwagi,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01261",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "只要相信自己的极其平庸的丑陋就可以了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I only had to believe in my own utterly ordinary ugliness.",
          "g": "predicate"
